msgctxt "#30105"
msgid "Configure 5200 Digital and Analog Joystick sensitivity and Analog deadzone.  Activate Swap, Dual Joysticks or Joy 2B+. Activate Paddle mode and set Paddle speed.  Set retroarch keyboard type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30106"
msgid "Apply gamepad input hacks required for specific games. 'Dual Stick' maps Player 2's joystick to the right analog stick of Player 1's RetroPad, enabling dual stick control in 'Robotron 2084' and 'Space Dungeon'. 'Swap Ports' maps Player 1 to port 2 and Player 2 to port 1 of the emulated console, correcting the swapped inputs of 'Wizard of Wor', 'Apple Panic' and a few other games. 'Joy 2B+' enables multibutton joysticks support."
msgstr ""

